# crontab for user apimon (crontab -e) - single-cycle mode.
# Run every 5 minutes; each service is only checked when its own JSON interval has
# elapsed (based on the persisted last-check time), so the 60/30/15-minute schedules
# in config.json are honoured without one cron line per service.
# The instance lock makes an overlapping run exit immediately (exit code 3), and the
# persisted state keeps alert suppression / reminders / recovery working across runs.
1,6,11,16,21,26,31,36,41,46,51,56 * * * * /opt/api-monitor/deploy/aix/api-monitor.sh once >/dev/null 2>&1
